        security: "Minimise personal data in templates, protect OTP flows with rate limits and short expiry, and restrict who can submit or edit templates.",
        checklist: ['Templates versioned in a repository', 'Correct category for each', 'Localised variants', 'Parameter validation before send', 'Quality monitoring', 'Early submission before launches', 'OTP templates with copy-code and limits'],
        sources: ['Meta for Developers: WhatsApp message templates and template categorisation (accessed October 2026)', 'Meta for Developers: Pricing on the WhatsApp Business Platform', 'Meta: WhatsApp Business messaging policy'],
